  "container.sword_forge": "Sword Forge",
  "death.attack.boss_instant_death": "%1$s was consumed by the pure white moon's reflection",
  "death.attack.white_mikazuki": "%1$s was pierced by the final strike of White Mikazuki Munechika",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.gotou_toushirou": "The little ones... I'm leaving them... in your care......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.hachisuka_kotetsu": "So I've lost... At this rate... the counterfeits in this world... will only grow more brazen... won't they?",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.heshikiri_hasebe": "Is this... the end...! My master's orders... can they be fulfilled... even without me......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.horikawa_kunihiro": "...No good... If I'm not here... Kane-san......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.ichigo_hitofuri": "Ahh... the world... is burning... back into... those flames......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.imanotsurugi": "The sky... so beautiful... purple... clouds......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.ishikirimaru": "Living so long as a divine blade... have I forgotten the duty of a weapon? ...If so... this was an inevitable end......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.kasen_kanesada": "Ahh... so this is the far shore... I ought to compose a poem... Who... will bring me my brush...",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.kashuu_kiyomitsu": "Was I... loved... until the very end...?",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.mikazuki_munechika": "All that has form will eventually perish. It simply happens to be today.",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.mutsunokami_yoshiyuki": "What... so this is where I end? ...The new era... I won't get to see it...",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.nikkari_aoe": "After fighting all this way... these things happen.",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.ookurikara": "Fighting alone... dying alone... this is enough for me......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.shokudaikiri_mitsutada": "Falling in battle is a common thing. Even so... this ruins my image.",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.tomoegata_naginata": "As a nameless naginata... I did... pretty well, didn't I......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.tonbokiri": "So... flawless victory... is impossible after all. I shall go first... please forgive me......",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.tsurumaru_kuninaga": "How troublesome... clothes dyed completely red like this... don't look like a crane at all...",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.yamanbagiri_chogi": "Damn... damn... damndamndamn...! Why... me...!",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.yamanbagiri_kunihiro": "Ahh... How unpleasant... Even after I vanish, will I still be compared...?",
  "death.toukenranbu_mod.yamatonokami_yasusada": "Okita-kun... finally... by your side......",
