  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_gotou_toushirou": "I'm Gotou Toushirou. I'm growing bigger and bigger!",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_hachisuka_kotetsu": "I'm Hachisuka Kotetsu. I hope you won't confuse me with a counterfeit.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_heshikiri_hasebe": "My name is Heshikiri Hasebe. If it is my master's command, I shall accomplish anything for you.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_horikawa_kunihiro": "Excuse me—, Kane-san... Has Izuminokami Kanesada arrived yet? I'm Horikawa Kunihiro. Pleased to meet you.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_ichigo_hitofuri": "I am Ichigo Hitofuri. The only tachi ever forged by Awataguchi Yoshimitsu. The Toushirou brothers are my younger siblings.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_imanotsurugi": "I'm Imanotsurugi! Lord Yoshitsune's protective blade! Pretty amazing, right!",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_ishikirimaru": "I am Ishikirimaru. Do you wish to cure an illness? ...Oh my, you're not a worshipper.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_kasen_kanesada": "I'm Kasen Kanesada, a cultured sword who appreciates elegance and refinement. Pleased to make your acquaintance.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_kashuu_kiyomitsu": "Ah—I'm Kashuu Kiyomitsu, child of the river. I may be difficult to handle, but my performance is excellent.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_mikazuki_munechika": "I am Mikazuki Munechika. Named Mikazuki for the many patterns formed during forging. Please take care of me.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_mutsunokami_yoshiyuki": "I'm Mutsunokami Yoshiyuki. We've finally made it to this grand place, so let's seize the world!",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_nikkari_aoe": "I'm Nikkari Aoe. Mm-hmm, you think it's a strange name too, don't you?",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_ookurikara": "...I'm Ookurikara. Nothing to say. I don't intend to get along with any of you.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_shokudaikiri_mitsutada": "I'm Shokudaikiri Mitsutada, the blade that can slice through bronze candlesticks. ...Mmm, still not cool enough, huh.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_tomoegata_naginata": "Naginata, Tomoegata. A collective of nameless, legendless, storyless Tomoegata. That is me.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_tonbokiri": "Arriving at full speed. I am Tonbokiri. Always ready to deploy at any moment.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_tsurumaru_kuninaga": "Yo. I'm Tsurumaru Kuninaga. Surprised by my sudden arrival?",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_yamanbagiri_chogi": "I am the original Uchigatana forged by Nagakuni, Yamanbagiri. The combat performance at Jurakudai earned high praise, so I was assigned here... Well then.",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_yamanbagiri_kunihiro": "Yamanbagiri Kunihiro. ...What's with that look? Does it bother you that I'm a replica?",
  "message.toukenranbu_mod.summon_yamatonokami_yasusada": "Yamatonokami Yasusada. Difficult to handle, but I believe I'm a fine sword.",
  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.capture_ball.empty": "Empty Capture Talisman",
