  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.group_capture_ball.usage": "Right-click block to capture all owned Touken Danshi within 32 blocks. Sneak + right-click to release all.",
  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.moon_phase.line1": "A moon phase rests quietly in your hand, cold and silent.",
  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.moon_phase.line2": "It seems to resonate with something deep within the White Night Garden...",
  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.white_mikazuki.line1": "A weapon dropped after defeating the dying White Mikazuki Munechika.",
  "tooltip.toukenranbu_mod.white_mikazuki.line2": "A single swing deals 2147483646 true damage to the target, bypassing armor, enchantments, and resistance effects. Afterward, it shatters completely and cannot be repaired.",
  "toukenranbu.book.name": "Touken Ranbu Encyclopedia",
  "toukenranbu.landing_text": "Welcome to the world of Touken Ranbu.The Touken Ranbu Encyclopedia covers all detailed data of the Touken Ranbu mod (excluding building blocks and the like).Everything you discover will be recorded within."
